Tests ability to formalize a cost-benefit for a privacy-preserving on-device biometric feature, balancing security, UX latency, and regulatory constraints.

## Key Concepts

- On-device ML footprint and energy budgeting
- Privacy-by-design and regulatory alignment (DP, PCI-DSS)
- Drift detection, calibration, and validation cost modeling
- OTA bandwidth planning and rollout strategy

